Chase all 275.

EuroScore is a road log for UEFA's fifty-five member associations. Every country you reach goes on one map, and into one score.

Lived there is 5. A night is 4. A real stop is 3. A foot across the line is 2. Passing through is 1. Unexplored stays at 0.

Color the map by how well you know each country, mark it plain green, or cut your own photos to the shape of the country. Add the season, the year, and a short note. Then share a scorecard.

Your scores, notes, and photos stay on this device. Export a copy whenever you want, or delete the whole log in Settings.

This app is based on UEFA's classification. It is not affiliated with UEFA.

EuroScore shows ads.
